    "description": "This dataset accompanies the 2024 edition of the synthesis study Klimaneutrales Deutschland, following the 2021 edition. The scenario assumes climate neutrality for Germany by 2045. The dataset contains the central input parameters, baseline data and results of the scenario modeling, providing detailed insights into technological developments as well as the economic and infrastructural decisions along the pathways to climate neutrality.",
